  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'This project began in December 2023, with an ambitious vision to create
    a comprehensive digital twin of TheHexaTown. The journey started with meticulous
    building measurements, which laid the foundation for the subsequent phases of
    development. These measurements were critical in ensuring that the virtual representation
    would be as accurate and detailed as possible, reflecting the real-world structures
    and environments of TheHexaTown.



    The initial phase involved a thorough
    and precise measurement of buildings within TheHexaTown. This process was carried
    out using advanced surveying techniques and tools, capturing every dimension
    and detail. The data collected included structural dimensions, spatial relationships,
    and architectural features, ensuring a robust dataset for the modeling phase.



    With
    the measurement data in hand, the next phase was to create a 3D model using Blender,
    a powerful open-source 3D modeling software. The modeling process involved translating
    the raw measurement data into a detailed and accurate 3D representation. This
    phase required a high level of skill and precision, as every detail needed to
    be faithfully reproduced in the virtual model. The resulting 3D model served
    as a digital replica of the physical buildings and spaces in TheHexaTown, providing
    a solid foundation for further development.



    After the model was created
    in Blender, it was exported to Unity, a versatile game engine known for its capabilities
    in creating immersive experiences. Using Unity, the project expanded to incorporate
    Augmented Reality (AR) and Virtual Reality (VR) features, allowing users to interact
    with the digital twin in innovative ways. Currently, the project is available
    on the web, enabling broader accessibility.



    Looking ahead, the project
    aims to integrate Internet of Things (IoT) technologies, transforming it into
    a dynamic and interactive digital twin of TheHexaTown. This integration will
    enable real-time data monitoring and control, enhancing the functionality and
    utility of the digital twin. The ultimate goal is to create a comprehensive,
    interactive, and intelligent representation of TheHexaTown, providing valuable
    insights and capabilities for various applications.'
